                                "sense_id": "60374a49-d265-3e98-855b-5e3d1589434d",
                                "text": "Beyond that, Neopaganism may be most helpfully identified by what it is not, neither Christian nor Judaic, neither monotheistic nor agnostic, neither Oriental nor humanist."
